WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:36.950 --> 01:41.700
Geez, what are you doing so early in the morning?

01:43.540 --> 01:47.000
What's gotten into you? You're usually such a sleepyhead.

01:48.750 --> 01:52.210
Be quiet. If you don't like it, just go home and go back to sleep.

01:52.210 --> 01:55.510
I'll fall behind Miyako if I slack off. I have to do my best!

01:55.510 --> 01:57.630
You'll probably give up in a couple of days.

02:10.310 --> 02:13.020
This melody...sounds like the music of Heaven!

02:14.320 --> 02:16.940
Music of Heaven? What are you talking about?

02:20.990 --> 02:23.080
But it is good music.

02:23.740 --> 02:26.040
I wonder what kind of person is playing it?

02:36.460 --> 02:37.550
Beautiful...

02:43.810 --> 02:50.480
Steal the Melody of Love!

03:20.470 --> 03:21.800
What's wrong, Mimi?

03:24.220 --> 03:25.640
Go away!

03:26.600 --> 03:29.020
Get away from me!

03:29.980 --> 03:32.400
What are you so excited about?

03:34.730 --> 03:37.360
Oh, you were just chasing the bee.

03:38.440 --> 03:43.200
Mimi, even the life of the smallest being is precious.

03:43.200 --> 03:45.160
Don't chase it without a reason.

03:45.160 --> 03:46.740
Beautiful...

03:48.080 --> 03:50.410
Go on home.

03:51.210 --> 03:56.380
"Even the life of the smallest being is precious."

03:57.090 --> 03:58.300
What the...?!

03:58.300 --> 04:00.300
You're a very kind person.

04:00.300 --> 04:03.840
That's why you can play such a beautiful melody, isn't it?

04:04.430 --> 04:06.140
The angel statue?

04:10.810 --> 04:12.190
What am I thinking?

04:12.190 --> 04:17.230
No! An Angel comes to those with a pure heart.

04:17.230 --> 04:20.650
If our hearts are connected, we can communicate with each other.

04:20.650 --> 04:23.200
Please play that melody again.

04:33.500 --> 04:34.210
Access...

04:35.670 --> 04:37.920
What are you doing here?

04:38.340 --> 04:40.210
Oh no! Could it be...?!

04:40.210 --> 04:42.760
Are you planning to take over his pure heart?

04:42.760 --> 04:46.140
- If you do, I'll never forgive you!

04:44.630 --> 04:46.140
- Hey, stop it!

04:46.140 --> 04:49.140
I only stopped by because I heard a melody...

04:49.140 --> 04:51.430
...that sounded like music from Heaven!

04:51.430 --> 04:55.770
Liar! You're after him because he has a pure heart!

04:55.770 --> 04:57.230
That's not true!

04:57.230 --> 05:01.400
Don't try to trick me! All you do is get in our way!

05:01.400 --> 05:04.950
Who is Sinbad, anyway? He's the Devil's servant, isn't he?

05:04.950 --> 05:06.910
Well...

05:06.910 --> 05:08.870
Why can't you tell me?

05:08.870 --> 05:14.000
You wouldn't believe me even if I told you, so just sit back and watch for now!

05:14.000 --> 05:16.460
Come back here!

05:16.460 --> 05:21.210
Coward! Even if you're after him, I'll protect him from you!

05:34.980 --> 05:38.020
Miyako, you've improved a lot recently.

05:38.020 --> 05:41.610
That's because I practice the basics a lot, unlike someone I know...

05:41.610 --> 05:44.530
Why do you have to act so arrogantly whenever I praise you a little?

05:44.530 --> 05:46.450
You don't understand.

05:46.450 --> 05:50.320
Whether it's studying or sports... The most important thing is the basics.

05:50.320 --> 05:54.620
As long as you practice the basics, you'll improve faster.

05:54.620 --> 05:58.370
Those who only care about looks are just like the hare.

05:58.370 --> 06:00.710
The hare? I don't get it.

06:00.710 --> 06:03.800
Stupid. I'm talking about "Tortoise and the Hare."

06:06.760 --> 06:09.720
Follow directions and work steadily towards that goal.

06:09.720 --> 06:11.890
That's the key to winning.

06:11.890 --> 06:13.390
Yeah, yeah.

06:13.390 --> 06:15.390
- I think she's right.

06:18.230 --> 06:20.020
<i>Ah! </i>Fin...<i></i>

06:22.320 --> 06:23.270
Good afternoon.

06:23.270 --> 06:25.730
What do you think you're doing?<i></i>

06:25.730 --> 06:27.730
Do you know him?

06:27.730 --> 06:29.950
N-Not really!

06:29.950 --> 06:31.660
What are you doing?<i></i>

06:31.660 --> 06:35.040
What a performance. It was wonderful and lovely.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.450
Nothing.

06:36.830 --> 06:39.250
I'm Toudaiji Miyako!

06:39.250 --> 06:40.880
I'm Kusakabe Maron.

06:40.880 --> 06:42.330
It's nice to meet you!

06:42.330 --> 06:46.760
If it's okay, I'd like to compose music while you two perform.

06:46.760 --> 06:48.420
Eh?! You're a composer?!

06:48.420 --> 06:49.720
Music for me?!

06:49.720 --> 06:52.090
- Get lost! It's for me!

06:51.220 --> 06:52.090
- For me!

06:54.680 --> 06:56.430
Be quiet, you two!

06:56.430 --> 07:00.560
He's a young and energetic music composer, Kimura Takumi-kun.

07:00.560 --> 07:02.980
I'm still learning.

07:02.980 --> 07:05.730
Pakkyamlamao-sensei, do you know him?

07:05.730 --> 07:10.110
Yes. I'm proud to say that he was an underclassman of mine.

07:10.110 --> 07:13.660
Kimura-kun is going to compete in the upcoming piano competition.

07:14.950 --> 07:19.750
If he wins the competition, he will go study piano in Europe.

07:19.750 --> 07:21.000
That's great!

07:21.000 --> 07:22.420
I don't know if I'll win, though.

07:22.420 --> 07:25.340
Yes, you will! Have more confidence in yourself!

07:25.340 --> 07:28.670
I had him come today to encourage you girls.

07:28.670 --> 07:32.840
Now go practice, so that Kimura-kun can compose music for you in the future.

07:32.840 --> 07:34.640
Okay!

07:35.430 --> 07:37.770
Kimura... Takumi-san...

07:43.100 --> 07:46.610
Please, can you gather more information about that person?

07:46.610 --> 07:49.110
I'm sure he's been targeted by a Demon.

07:49.110 --> 07:53.160
I saw Access sniffing around him. He might get hurt!

07:53.160 --> 07:57.330
That's it! I need to add some more salt.

07:57.330 --> 08:00.540
Maron! Be serious!

08:00.540 --> 08:02.330
Fin, could it be...?

08:02.330 --> 08:04.500
What?! What's with that look on your face?

08:05.380 --> 08:07.710
Did you fall in love with him?

08:07.710 --> 08:10.710
Eh?!! N-No, it's not that.

08:10.710 --> 08:12.300
You're blushing!

08:12.300 --> 08:14.090
You shouldn't ask about such things!

08:14.090 --> 08:19.180
He can play that pure melody, so he's likely to be targeted by a Demon.

08:19.180 --> 08:22.310
The Demon would consume the purity of his heart.

08:22.310 --> 08:26.900
Then Access would recover it, increasing the Devil's strength!

08:28.570 --> 08:31.610
Hmm, I still need more salt.

08:31.610 --> 08:33.360
Geez... I hate you!

08:33.360 --> 08:37.320
Maron, I can't believe you're the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc!

08:37.320 --> 08:41.040
An Angel wouldn't fall in love with a human, anyway.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.760
Takumi-san...

08:53.220 --> 08:56.180
The piano competition is coming up, isn't it?

08:56.180 --> 08:58.180
Shouldn't you be practicing?

08:58.180 --> 09:00.890
Are you really talking to me?

09:00.890 --> 09:03.100
I'm always at your side.

09:03.980 --> 09:06.480
Why aren't you practicing?

09:07.770 --> 09:10.230
You seem to be in pain.

09:10.230 --> 09:12.650
To be honest, I have no confidence in myself.

09:13.780 --> 09:17.110
My dad is a famous musician.

09:17.110 --> 09:20.200
He's one of the judges at the competition.

09:20.200 --> 09:24.210
Having a famous parent increases the pressure on me.

09:25.370 --> 09:29.920
It's hard to live up to my father's expectations.

09:29.920 --> 09:34.130
But you should be glad that there is someone who looks after you.

09:35.170 --> 09:41.180
I know someone who has lived apart from their parents since an early age...

09:41.180 --> 09:43.770
...and is lonely all the time.

09:43.770 --> 09:46.060
But rather than being depressed,

09:46.060 --> 09:49.400
she always says: "Strong and serious. Energetic and courageous."

09:49.400 --> 09:51.270
What's that?

09:51.270 --> 09:54.780
It's a phrase she made up herself, meant for no one but herself.

09:54.780 --> 09:58.320
It means that she needs to lead her own life and live it to the fullest.

09:58.320 --> 10:00.820
"Strong and serious..."

10:00.820 --> 10:03.330
"Energetic and courageous...?"

10:03.330 --> 10:04.910
It's a phrase I need.

10:07.210 --> 10:09.120
I think I can do it now.

10:09.920 --> 10:11.290
Thank you.

10:18.180 --> 10:20.010
I'm so glad.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.970
It's him again!

10:23.970 --> 10:24.930
Access!

10:24.930 --> 10:28.230
Fin-chan! Please don't get too close to him!

10:28.230 --> 10:31.480
I don't want a servant of the Devil calling me "Fin-chan!!!"

10:31.480 --> 10:32.400
Hmph!!

10:42.620 --> 10:44.620
It's a good piano.

10:44.620 --> 10:47.410
It will be used in tomorrow's competition.

10:47.410 --> 10:49.210
Practice with it, Takumi.

10:49.920 --> 10:53.000
Only I get to practice on it?

10:53.000 --> 10:54.550
I've already received permission.

10:55.050 --> 10:57.340
I don't want special treatment!

10:57.340 --> 10:58.840
What are you talking about?

10:58.840 --> 11:02.720
You are destined to become a world-famous composer.

11:02.720 --> 11:05.220
It's such a small thing. It's really nothing to worry about.

11:05.220 --> 11:09.310
With your skills as a composer, you can win if you practice.

11:10.100 --> 11:12.730
Practice all night until you're satisfied.

11:13.770 --> 11:16.400
All because of my father's prestige...

11:29.290 --> 11:30.620
Huh? What the...?!

11:30.620 --> 11:32.790
No! Don't come any closer!

11:32.790 --> 11:34.380
Are you there?

11:41.260 --> 11:44.140
Don't...go...

11:44.140 --> 11:47.060
near...the...piano...

11:56.110 --> 11:58.610
Takumi!

12:02.360 --> 12:04.990
Notice

12:02.360 --> 12:04.990
Don't go away!

12:02.360 --> 12:04.990
I'll return right after these messages!

12:02.360 --> 12:04.990
Kaitou Jeanne

12:05.870 --> 12:08.490
Notice

12:05.870 --> 12:08.490
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:05.870 --> 12:08.490
Kaitou Jeanne

12:12.290 --> 12:17.710
That Fin! What's she doing that's taking her so long?

12:22.050 --> 12:25.470
Maron... Maron, help...

12:26.220 --> 12:29.640
What's with that tired face? Were you playing all night?

12:29.640 --> 12:33.890
The Demon... Hurry and seal the Demon...

12:33.890 --> 12:35.440
Wait a minute. Hold on...

12:36.900 --> 12:41.320
Fin, did you approach a Demon by yourself?

12:41.320 --> 12:47.870
Something bad will happen to him if we don't seal the Demon before 6 o'clock.

12:47.870 --> 12:51.250
6 o'clock? That's when the piano competition starts.

12:51.250 --> 12:53.540
The Demon is in the piano hall.

12:53.540 --> 12:54.750
Eh?!

12:54.750 --> 12:57.250
Takumi-san has been possessed by the Demon...

12:57.250 --> 12:59.250
...all because he plays that beautiful melody.

12:59.250 --> 13:02.010
I just know Access is involved!

13:03.170 --> 13:04.380
Fin!

13:04.380 --> 13:06.470
What should I do?

13:08.930 --> 13:11.810
<i>Notice: To the competition staff:</i>

13:11.810 --> 13:15.980
<i>Today at 6:00 P.M., I'll come and take the beauty of the piano's sound.</i>

13:15.980 --> 13:16.900
<i>Kaitou Jeanne</i>

13:16.900 --> 13:20.440
What does she mean: "Take the beauty of the piano's sound?"

13:20.440 --> 13:22.070
I don't know.

13:22.070 --> 13:26.320
Everyone looks forward to attending the competition each year.

13:26.320 --> 13:29.870
I will stop you, Jeanne, if you try to ruin it.

13:31.450 --> 13:34.160
The guards are all in position outside.

13:34.160 --> 13:35.460
Good job.

13:35.460 --> 13:37.170
What's up with these clothes?

13:37.170 --> 13:40.630
I thought this is the kind of clothing I need to wear for a concert.

13:40.630 --> 13:45.340
With these, I'm sure Kaitou Jeanne won't think of us as police officers.

13:47.050 --> 13:49.720
You'll stick out like sore thumbs!

13:49.720 --> 13:51.180
Do you really think so?

13:51.810 --> 13:55.390
<i>Detective Toudaiji, the traps are set and ready.</i>

13:55.390 --> 13:58.690
- Roger!

13:56.230 --> 13:58.690
- Eh?! Fuyuta-san!

13:58.690 --> 14:02.110
Sir, what kind of trap did you set?

14:02.110 --> 14:04.230
I'll brief you all now.

14:06.860 --> 14:11.330
I have set up security cameras throughout the halls.

14:11.330 --> 14:16.710
If Jeanne sneaks in, we'll be able to see every move she makes.

14:16.710 --> 14:18.420
Oh, I see.

14:18.420 --> 14:21.880
Once I spot her, I will give orders from here.

14:21.880 --> 14:25.420
Your job is to make Jeanne come to this area.

14:25.420 --> 14:26.340
Got it?

14:26.340 --> 14:28.180
What's in this area?

14:28.180 --> 14:29.970
Emergency shutters.

14:31.850 --> 14:33.970
Exactly. If Jeanne comes here...

14:46.320 --> 14:48.820
She'll be trapped this way.

14:48.820 --> 14:50.490
This is today's plan.

14:50.490 --> 14:52.490
She'll be like a rat in a trap.

14:52.490 --> 14:54.910
What's the weight of the shutters?

14:54.910 --> 14:57.160
Just about 225 kilograms.

14:57.160 --> 14:59.420
It won't be easy getting out of this one.

15:00.580 --> 15:03.880
But we can't let our guard down.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.880
She might somehow escape.

15:05.880 --> 15:07.260
Leave it to me!

15:07.260 --> 15:11.760
I thought everything through and came up with a plan to confuse Jeanne.

15:11.760 --> 15:13.180
What might that be?

15:13.180 --> 15:14.350
That is...!

15:22.860 --> 15:26.440
Somewhere in there, Miyako and the detectives should be ready for me.

15:27.280 --> 15:32.870
Thirty minutes left. Please seal the Demon before Takumi-san plays!

15:36.870 --> 15:38.700
Are you okay, Fin?

15:38.700 --> 15:40.040
I'm fine...

15:42.620 --> 15:45.040
Ah! Access?! What's he doing here?!

15:48.090 --> 15:50.340
Access, why you...!

15:50.340 --> 15:51.220
Fin-chan!

15:51.220 --> 15:52.510
I won't forgive you!

15:52.510 --> 15:55.100
S-Stop it, please!

15:55.100 --> 15:56.050
What's this?

15:56.050 --> 15:56.720
Give that back!!!

15:56.720 --> 16:00.730
You! You were planning to collect pure hearts with this, weren't you?!

16:00.730 --> 16:03.020
Just to increase the Devil's strength!

16:03.020 --> 16:05.520
I can't tell you anything now!

16:05.520 --> 16:09.230
But...But I still like you, Fin-chan!

16:09.230 --> 16:12.910
What are you talking about?! I won't be fooled by that!

16:12.910 --> 16:16.780
I hate you! Let me see that!

16:19.290 --> 16:20.910
Ah!!! The pin!!!

16:25.210 --> 16:27.290
He won't get in our way now.

16:27.880 --> 16:29.590
Let's go!

16:33.090 --> 16:35.720
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

16:45.770 --> 16:47.900
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:47.900 --> 16:49.690
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:49.690 --> 16:51.490
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:56.950 --> 16:59.660
Kimura-kun is playing at 6:00 P.M., huh?

16:59.660 --> 17:02.410
He's first, then.

17:03.910 --> 17:07.210
You're late, Access! Were you playing in the lake?

17:07.210 --> 17:10.550
It's not that. I dropped the pin.

17:10.550 --> 17:12.090
What?! The pin?!

17:12.090 --> 17:17.340
Fin-chan attacked me and it dropped into the lake.

17:17.340 --> 17:18.800
Why, you little...!

17:18.800 --> 17:20.760
Forgive me!!!

17:33.940 --> 17:35.860
It's almost time.

17:39.990 --> 17:43.120
Fin, I'll take it from here.

17:43.120 --> 17:47.210
If you get any closer to the Demon, you'll get weaker.

17:47.210 --> 17:48.130
But...

17:50.750 --> 17:52.750
Jeanne is coming!

17:52.750 --> 17:57.840
Area 13, near the side entrance, Jeanne is there. Proceed immediately!

17:59.340 --> 18:01.220
ROGER!

18:01.220 --> 18:04.350
Roger!

18:05.680 --> 18:08.150
I found her! I found Jeanne!

18:08.150 --> 18:09.980
Jeanne!

18:12.320 --> 18:13.230
Stop!

18:13.230 --> 18:14.030
This way!

18:22.660 --> 18:24.330
Stop!

18:25.370 --> 18:27.210
Don't let her get away.

18:29.000 --> 18:34.340
Cloakroom

18:32.750 --> 18:34.340
Here! She's in here!

18:44.680 --> 18:45.970
Hey! Wait!

18:45.970 --> 18:50.020
How? How did he know where I was?

18:51.100 --> 18:54.230
I thought the concert hall was this way.

18:54.230 --> 18:57.070
Fin, it's okay, so you go back and rest.

18:57.070 --> 19:01.160
No! I want to help him!

19:01.160 --> 19:02.320
Fin...

19:03.330 --> 19:08.620
Okay. Jeanne is heading towards the hall with the emergency shutters.

19:08.620 --> 19:12.040
Keep chasing Jeanne until we can trap her!

19:12.040 --> 19:13.670
Understood!

19:13.670 --> 19:15.300
Leave it to us!

19:15.300 --> 19:16.920
Let's go!

19:18.880 --> 19:21.340
Now's the best time! Dad, activate the emergency shutters!

19:21.340 --> 19:22.590
Got it!

19:32.560 --> 19:33.860
Fin!

19:36.360 --> 19:42.410
Kaitou Jeanne! You're now trapped like a rat! Give it up!

19:46.240 --> 19:49.080
Miyako Special, Part Six.

19:52.710 --> 19:55.500
Jeanne! Over here! Hurry!

19:57.960 --> 19:59.460
Fin!

20:12.230 --> 20:13.810
In the name of God...

20:13.810 --> 20:16.020
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:16.020 --> 20:17.520
I seal you here!

20:17.520 --> 20:18.610
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:30.410 --> 20:31.830
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:31.830 --> 20:33.670
Adieu!

20:34.420 --> 20:36.540
Hey, are you all right?

20:42.420 --> 20:44.680
The piano...doesn't play.

20:44.680 --> 20:47.890
Is this what she meant by "steal the piano's sound?"

20:47.890 --> 20:49.600
But I don't get it.

20:50.600 --> 20:54.690
Hey! Help carry the replacement piano!

21:03.110 --> 21:11.660
<i>No one owns it. Play your music for yourself alone.</i>

21:12.370 --> 21:15.120
<i>Strong...and...serious...</i>

21:15.120 --> 21:17.750
<i>Energetic...and...courageous...</i>

21:26.010 --> 21:30.510
Takumi-san is playing. He's playing with his pure heart.

21:30.510 --> 21:33.020
Thank you, Jeanne.

21:33.020 --> 21:34.640
Fin, is that okay with you?

21:35.730 --> 21:41.360
He... If he wins, he'll go to Europe.

21:41.360 --> 21:44.650
It's okay. That's the way it should be.

21:46.030 --> 21:47.160
Fin...

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.180
Stop, Sinbad!

23:34.180 --> 23:37.520
I came here to catch that Demon... I will not let anyone interfere!

23:37.520 --> 23:42.100
Stop this violence... This person was possessed by a Demon, and now he's dying.

23:42.100 --> 23:44.810
I won't forgive you for harming him!

23:44.810 --> 23:47.530
So you intend to stop me, no matter what...

23:47.530 --> 23:49.610
However, I don't have time to play with you.

23:49.610 --> 23:53.030
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Heartless <i>Checkmate</i>

23:53.030 --> 23:55.910
I will do anything to catch the Demon.

23:55.910 --> 23:59.290
Jeanne, are you any different?
